### Configure TypeOrmModule.forRoot in AppModule

Source: https://github.com/nestjs/docs.nestjs.com/blob/master/content/data/typeorm.md

Imports and configures TypeOrmModule in the root module with database credentials and options. Do not use synchronize: true in production to prevent data loss.

```typescript
@@filename(app.module)
import { Module } from '@nestjs/common';
import { TypeOrmModule } from '@nestjs/typeorm';

@Module({
  imports: [
    TypeOrmModule.forRoot({
      type: 'mysql',
      host: 'localhost',
      port: 3306,
      username: 'root',
      password: 'root',
      database: 'test',
      entities: [],
      synchronize: true,
    }),
  ],
})
export class AppModule {}
```

